{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","布鲁特斯"],["/names/en","Brutus"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名英勇的战士，善于冲锋陷阵。"],["/description_i18n/en","A valiant warrior who is indomitable in the front line."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","让敌人颤抖吧！"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","For the god of war!"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","蛮血必将辉煌！"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","The Maulers will inevitably gain glory."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","狂刃——风暴！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Frenzied blade! Storm!"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","继续……进攻！！"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","Keep going... attack!"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","杰出的胜利，各位，棒极了。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","A great victory, the glory of which belongs to each and every warrior."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","无论何种战场，我都将全力以赴"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","No matter the outcome, I'll give this battle my all."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","好，准备结束！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Alright... Ready. FInish this!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","状态不错老伙计！"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Maulers will be victorious!"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","蛮血必胜。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Mmm, old friend. Hah! That's the way."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","用心的礼物，多谢。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","A heartfelt gift; many thanks."],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","好，我收下了。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","Very well, I'll take it."],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","蛮血战神"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/en","Blood Claw"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","战争永远只是战争。即使身为战神。正因身为战神。"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/en","Warriors don't choose their fate. They embrace it."],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","破敌锋刃"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/en","Ravaging Cleave"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","他永远身先士卒。从未退却，从未恐惧，从未败北。"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/en","Unyielding to weariness, unswayed by dread. He never knew defeat, nor paused, nor fled."],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","完成剧情任务“残阳武斗场（下）”特定环节获得。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/en","Complete Story Quest - Sunseek Arena II"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","精英"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/en","Elite"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","是个休息的好地方"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","What a great place to rest."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","好久没这样休息了"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","I haven't been this well-rested for a long time."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","给我来一杯吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I'll have one, please."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","外面下雪了啊"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","It's snowing outside!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","到隆冬节了啊……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","It's the Winter Carnival..."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","真是热闹啊"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Such a bustling crowd!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","要去看他们比武吗？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Would you like a spar?"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","布鲁特斯力大无穷，能够用常人无法举起的巨剑使出精妙的剑法。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","Brutus' incomparable strength allows him to expertly wield a colossal blade, one that ordinary people have no hope of even lifting."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","据说布鲁特斯的巨剑是上古时代的灵器，除了自己选择的主人外，无人能将其举起。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","Some say that Brutus' sword is an artifact from a bygone age and that no one can wield it except for its chosen master."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","蛮血生性好战，但鲜少有人敢于直接挑战布鲁特斯。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","While Maulers are known for their love of battle, few are daring enough to challenge this war chief. \"Brutus is the pinnacle of martial prowess. That's why he's been my rival ever since we were young.\" —Orson"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","“那不是敌人的血！只是一种辛辣的红汤。”布鲁特斯本人如此回应关于他日常饮食的谣言。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","\"This isn't the blood of my enemies! It's just spicy meatball stew, that's all!\"—Brutus, when asked about his rumored eating habits."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","“当时那柄巨剑已经横在我的脖子上了，可是他却说——点到为止。”输给布鲁特斯的挑战者如是说。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","\"When his gigantic blade was at my throat, I was ready to accept my fate... That's when he said, 'I think we're done here.'\"—Testimony from one of Brutus' challengers."],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","即使是空中的一片羽毛，布鲁特斯也能准确的用那柄巨剑劈成两半。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","Brutus is capable of swinging his massive blade with enough precision to slice a floating feather in half."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","布鲁特斯嗜辣，尤其喜爱一种形似兽牙的辣椒，众多人挑战这种调料之后都对布鲁特斯多了分佩服。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","Brutus loves spicy food, especially anything made with a type of pepper that resembles a beast's fang. Many people admire Brutus even more after trying the seasoning he uses."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","布鲁特斯不拘小节，身着华服、编上发辫时会有些不自在。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","Brutus is not fond of formalities and feels rather uncomfortable when wearing fine clothes and having his mane braided."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","据说，布鲁特斯曾将值得尊敬的对手的盔甲碎片埋在一座高山之巅，从此再未踏足。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","It is said that Brutus buried the fragments of armor from a very worthy adversary on the top of a high mountain and never set foot there again."],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","“他的胸怀宽广，这比实力更可贵。”克鲁格在看过兄长决斗落败却保住性命后，如此评价布鲁特斯。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","\"His big, open heart is far more valuable than his impressive strength.\" —Kruger, upon seeing Brutus spare his defeated brother."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","刚成为蛮血战神时，我的确沉浸在喜悦之中。而那份喜悦却是战神头衔唯一的褒奖……"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","When I first got dubbed Blood Claw, I was over the moon. That was probably the only good thing about that title..."],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411080.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11411080.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","布鲁特斯"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Brutus"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","难得看到布鲁特斯大人在这里休息！"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","It's rare to see Lord Brutus rest here!"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/ep1/herohub_story/11411170.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/ep1/herohub_story/11411170.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","阿尔萨 & 布鲁特斯"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Alsa & Brutus"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","你就是他们说的战神，布鲁特斯？"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","You're Brutus, aren't you? I hear some folks call you the Blood Claw. They say that you're a god of war."],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415705.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415705.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","那非 & 布鲁特斯"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Nazrik & Brutus"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","这里加一点红色……这里的地面上，再加上很多红色的花！"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","Add some red here... And add more red flowers right there on the ground!"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415017.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415017.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","噜噜 & 布鲁特斯"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Lumont & Brutus"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","呀呼！非常荣幸见到您，伟大的蛮血战神！"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","Woohoo! It's an honor to be in your presence, the great Blood Claw!"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415036.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415036.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","曼卡拉 & 布鲁特斯"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Mikola & Brutus"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","是个休息的好地方"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","What a great place to rest."],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415070.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415070.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","布鲁特斯"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Brutus"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","给我来一杯吧"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","I'll have one, please."],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415071.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415071.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","布鲁特斯"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Brutus"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","布鲁特斯大人！隆冬节快乐！今年节日您有什么安排吗？"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","Lord Brutus! Happy Winter Carnival! Do you have any exciting plans for the holiday this year?"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415344.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415344.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","阿尔萨 & 布鲁特斯"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Alsa & Brutus"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","外面下雪了啊"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","It's snowing outside!"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415379.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415379.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","布鲁特斯"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Brutus"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","到隆冬节了啊……"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/en","It's the Winter Carnival..."],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415380.json"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415380.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","布鲁特斯"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/en","Brutus"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","真是热闹啊"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/en","Such a bustling crowd!"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415551.json"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415551.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","布鲁特斯"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/en","Brutus"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","要去看他们比武吗？"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/en","Would you like a spar?"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415552.json"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415552.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","布鲁特斯"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/en","Brutus"]]}